      "trajectory": [
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP1-1 — 水の都の依頼（開幕）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Opening / Call / Team Setup\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\",\n    \"ghost\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/ghost/\"\n  },\n  \"antagon",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
