      "trajectory": [
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP1-3 — 余韻（問い）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Resolution / Afterthoughts\n\n「彼は……生まれ変わりました」\n「うん」\n「Tamaki、手は震えてる」\n「少しだけ。だいじょうぶ」\n\n窓の外、運河が橙に沈む。私は問いを胸に置く。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 1
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
