        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP5-1 — 形式と文脈（共同体の法廷）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Case Entry / Tension\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\",\n    \"company\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/company/\"\n  },\n  \"antagon",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 1
