      "trajectory": [
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 1,
          "segmentText": "# EP10-1 — ゾンビ・スイープ（社会衛生）\n- POV: 私（Tamaki／環樹）\n- Beat: Cleanup / Quiet Return\n\n```json\n{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@base\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/\",\n    \"gh\": \"https://ghosthacker.junkawasaki.com/gh#\",\n    \"antagonist\": { \"@id\": \"gh:antagonist\", \"@type\": \"@id\" },\n    \"company\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/company/\",\n    \"character\": \"https://ghosthacker.example.com/character/\"\n  },\n  \"ant",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 2,
          "segmentText": "大事なのは“切り捨て”じゃない。不要なループを /dev/null に流しながら、残すべき関係線を守ること。私はTree of Lifeに触れ、手順を一つずつ実行する。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 3,
          "segmentText": "敵は“ゾンビ・ループ”——誰の意思でもない排除の規範だ。私はそれを一つずつ外していく。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 4,
          "segmentText": "Aoi「このタグは残す？」\n私「うん。誰かが帰って来られる目印になる」\n掃除とは、戻れる道を残すこと。朝のアナウンスが流れ、街の騒音が半歩だけ下がった。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anger",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "surprise",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "trust",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "anticipation",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "disgust",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "@type": "EmotionProfile",
          "position": 5,
          "segmentText": "「おかえり」\n朝になって、街が少し静かだ。静けさは退屈じゃない。呼吸みたいなもの。私は自分の胸に手を置き、次の依頼に備える。",
          "emotionVector": [
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "joy",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "relief",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "hope",
              "score": 0.3333
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "sadness",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
              "emotion": "fear",
              "score": 0
            },
            {
              "@type": "EmotionScore",
